{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064735/block/singleImage/3272608/df/1608211784_Bi.JPG?updatedAt=1795097330\"/><figcaption>東區醫院一名89歲女患者今午病逝。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日(19日)下午4時許，3名男子騎單車由西沙GO PARK，前往深涌營地，至深涌碼頭附近，其中一名71歲的戴姓男子突然暈倒，不省人事。</p><p>同行友人見狀立即報警求助，政府飛行服務隊派出直升機協助，事主其後送往東區醫院搶救。據報事主有身體病紀錄，警方正調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.627255+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:08:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:15.224940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:04.686578+00:00","content_hash":"3e528e4257acdda810b49531c24b3607e8006c90b03eb4615746696ae429a98e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.627255+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}